    "download_disabled":  false,
    "description":  "\u003cp\u003eThese datasets contain the base case model used for the evaluation and implementation of plantwide control strategies as well as the different datasets produced during the implementation of these strategies.  A systematic approach, using a simulated model of the plant, was followed to investigate plantwide control measures and thereby refine the plant\u0027s control philosophy. A steady-state model of a Wet gas Sulfuric Acid plant was developed using Aspen HYSYS software.  \u003c/p\u003e",
